# Keep the build context small and never ship secrets or local state into an image.

# Zero-byte placeholder files. This repository lives in a OneDrive-synced folder,
# and OneDrive converts empty files into cloud-only ReparsePoints that BuildKit
# cannot read, failing the build with "invalid file request". They carry no
# content, so excluding them costs nothing (docs/architecture.md ADR-016).
.gitkeep
**/.gitkeep

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
coverage.xml
*.egg-info/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# tests/ is intentionally NOT excluded: CI runs pytest inside the built image,
# and a few KB of test files is cheaper than a second build context.
.git/
.gitignore
README.md
